This licence applies to the source code in this repository only.

It does NOT extend to third-party demographic or regulatory data, which are
not distributed here and remain under their own terms:

  - Human Mortality Database (HMD) estimates -- CC BY 4.0. HMD *input* data
    carry a stricter licence set by the originating national statistical
    offices and are never copied into this repository. See
    backend/data/hmd/DOWNLOAD_GUIDE.md.
  - INEGI (defunciones registradas) and CONAPO (proyecciones de poblacion) --
    terms of the Mexican federal open-data framework.
  - CNSF / CUSF regulatory mortality tables -- published by the Comision
    Nacional de Seguros y Fianzas.

Required HMD citation for any published work using this project:

    HMD. Human Mortality Database. Max Planck Institute for Demographic
    Research (Germany), University of California, Berkeley (USA), and French
    Institute for Demographic Studies (France). Available at www.mortality.org.
